issue_comment:
To make it clearer what the core problem is:
```
; RUN: opt -S -passes=instsimplify
@g = constant { i40, i8 } { i40 0, i8 1 }
define i8 @f() {
  %v = load i8, ptr getelementptr (i8, ptr @g, i64 6)
  ret i8 %v
}
```
This is accessing the padding between the store size and the alloc size of `i40`, which ReadDataFromGlobal does not correctly handle.

