issue_body:
This seems to be a regression from 17 to 18/trunk. 

```cpp
template <typename, typename...>
struct X {
  template <typename>
  struct Y {
    template <typename T>
    Y(T) {}
  };

  template <typename T, typename... Vs>
  Y(T, Vs...) -> Y<T>;
};

