issue_body:
Run clang-format on this code:
```cpp
void test() {
    for (const TestCase& test_case : {
           TestCase{
               .a = 1,
               .b = "1",
           },
           TestCase{
               .a = 2,
               .b = "2",
           },
       })  {}
}
```
In the output, the field names for the second fields are misindented:
```cpp
void test() {
  for (const TestCase& test_case : {
           TestCase{
               .a = 1,
     .b = "1",
           },
           TestCase{
               .a = 2,
      .b = "2",
           },
       }) {
  }
}
```

I expect them to be at the same level of indent as the first field.

