issue_body:
Consider the following function.
https://godbolt.org/z/TcT461xq4
```cpp
int test(int a) {
  if (a / 5)
    return 0;
  else
    return (a / 6);
}
```

In this example, the fraction `(a / 6)` in else branch can be optimized (to zero) under the condition `(a / 5) == 0`.

