OH. DOH. 
`ConstraintSatisfaction.Details` is a SmallVector, and we do a bunch of `emplace_back` on it which invalidate the iterators with which we then try to partially erase the vector. UB.

We missed it.

@hazohelet are you willing to work on a fix? Storing the original size instead of the current end would work.

@erichkeane for visibility.

